# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Editor/IDE
.idea/
.vscode/

.task
bin
frontend/dist
frontend/node_modules
.pnpm-store/
.wails-dev.*.log
# ---- build/ 下的生成产物 ----
# 以下文件都由 wails3 在每次构建时重新生成（挂在 build/*/Taskfile.yml 的 build:native deps 上），
# 数据源是 build/config.yml 与 build/appicon.png，手改会被无条件覆盖，因此不进版本库。
# 未列出的是 wails3 init 的一次性脚手架，永不重新生成，必须提交：
#   build/config.yml、build/appicon.png、build/*/Taskfile.yml、
#   build/windows/nsis/project.nsi、build/windows/msix/*.xml、
#   build/linux/appimage/build.sh、build/linux/nfpm/scripts/*.sh

# wails3 update build-assets
build/windows/info.json
build/windows/wails.exe.manifest
build/windows/nsis/wails_tools.nsh
build/linux/desktop
build/linux/nfpm/nfpm.yaml
# 同上。本项目只做 Windows 与 Linux，但该命令是整平台一起铺开模板的，挡不掉
build/darwin/Info.plist
build/darwin/Info.dev.plist
build/ios/

# wails3 generate icons（源：build/appicon.png 与 build/<iconName>.png）
build/windows/*.ico
build/darwin/icon.icns

# wails3 generate .desktop / webview2bootstrapper / appimage
build/linux/*.desktop
build/linux/appimage/build
build/windows/nsis/MicrosoftEdgeWebview2Setup.exe
KCES_MOD_EDITOR.exe
/game
/testdata
/COM3D2_MOD_EDITOR
/MeidoSerialization
build/windows/nsis/wails_tools.nsh
build/windows/nsis/wails_tools.nsh
